{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":496,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAg"},"children":[]},{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["In-Game Reward information"]}]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"hr","props":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["It is not possible to get the virtual item attached to this product unless bought through the Roblox commercial store, which is the Merch Shop in the lobby."]},{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]},"Only players that reside in the United States of America, and are over the age of 13 (unless residing in the state of Texas, where this is over the age of 18) can access this store. Players outside the United States of America are able to purchase the physical product via ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"https://shop.paradoxum.games/"},"children":["Paradoxum Games store"]}," but will not get the virtual item attached to this product."]},"\n"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBQ"},"children":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Engineer_Plush"},"children":["Engineer Plush"]},"\n"]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCA"},"children":["\n\n\n"]},{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCg"},"children":["\n\n"]},"\n","\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwDQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Description"},"children":["Description"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Engineer Plush"]}," is an official Paradoxum Games toy. It was made by Juniper Creates™. The plushie offers the Default Level 6 ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Engineer","title":"Engineer"},"children":["Engineer"]},". AAnybody who bought the toy from the in-game Merch Store will receive the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Plushie"]}]}," skin for the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Engineer","title":"Engineer"},"children":["Engineer"]},".  If bought on the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"https://shop.paradoxum.games/"},"children":["Paradoxum Games store"]},", it will not come with any rewards."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The rebar launcher of the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Engineer Plush"]}," is detachable. It is made out of plush fabric and polypropylene cotton, its size measures 12 inches (30.48 cm) tall, 10.5 inches (26.67 cm) wide and 7.48 inches (19 cm) long. A tree is planted for every order of the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Engineer Plush"]},"."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwFw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Official_Description"},"children":["Official Description"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Online (Third)"]},"\n",{"type":"dl","props":{},"children":[{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":["This Engineer Plush is armed and ready and you know her aim is steady. Her weapon is attachable via Velcro for a quick setup when she needs to defend. This plush does not include an in-game reward."]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Online (Second)"]},"\n",{"type":"dl","props":{},"children":[{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":["This Engineer Plush is armed and ready and you know her aim is steady. Her weapon is attachable via Velcro for a quick setup when she needs to defend. The in-game reward is only included with purchases made in Roblox. Items purchased from shop.paradoxum.games do not include an in-game reward."]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Online (First)"]},